            },
            {
              "id": "text_j",
              "type": "text",
              "name": "This appliance is no",
              "x": 153.54330708661416,
              "y": 358.02622061425245,
              "w": 1375.984251968504,
              "h": 2004.1785037951963,
              "rotation": 0,
              "opacity": 1,
              "locked": false,
              "visible": true,
              "groupPath": [],
              "text": "This appliance is not intended for use by persons (including children) with reduced physical, sensory or mental capabilities, or lack of experience and knowledge, unless they have been given supervision or instruction concerning use of the appliance by a person responsible for their safety.\nThis appliance can be used by children aged from 8 years and above and persons with reduced physical, sensory or mental capabilities or lack of experience and knowledge if they have been given supervision or instruction concerning use of the appliance in a safe way and understand the hazards involved. Children shall not play with the appliance. Cleaning and user maintenance shall not be made by children without supervision.\nChildren should be supervised to ensure that they do not play with the appliance.\nThe appliance has to be unplugged after use and before carrying out user maintenance on the appliance.\nThe plug must be removed from the socket-outlet before cleaning or maintaining the appliance.\nIf the supply cord is damaged, it must be replaced by the manufacturer, its service agent or similarly qualified persons in order to avoid a hazard.\nDo not immerse in water for cleaning.\nThe liquid or steam must not be directed towards equipment containing electrical components, such as the interior of ovens\nDo not touch the plug or any electrical parts with wet hands – risk of electric shock.\nDo not use the plug or wire that is damaged to avoid danger, and contact our after-sales service center.\nWhen using, the airflow channel and moving parts should be kept away from long hair, loose clothing, fingers, and other parts of the body.\nDo not insert metal wires (such as pins, fine iron wires, copper wires, the gaps of the product, as it may cause electric shock.\nOnly our professional technical personnel are allowed to repair or disassemble this product.\nWhen it is not in use, the product should be unplugged to avoid electric leakage, short circuit, fire, and accidents.\nIf any abnormality occurs during use, unplug the product immediately and contact our after-sales service center for assistance.\nAfter using the product, clean the dirty water tank promptly to keep the air duct clear and prevent blockages. Blockages may result in reduced suction performance, motor overheating, and a shortened product lifespan.\nIntended for indoor cleaning (e.g., beds, sofas, carpets). Do not use outdoors, commercially, or in industrial environments.\nPlease add the cleaning agent provided by our company accordingto the instructions to prevent excessive foam from penetrating the motor, which may damagge the motor or reduce its performance.",
              "fontFamily": "MiSans",
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fontSize": 29.166666666666668,
              "lineHeight": 1.1428571428571428,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "paragraphSpaceBefore": 41.666666666666664,
              "paragraphSpaceAfter": 0,
