            {
              "id": "text_l",
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Do not shake the pro",
              "x": 1835.1539148905242,
              "y": 262.19302954404856,
              "w": 1375.984251968504,
              "h": 815.2634493767428,
              "rotation": 0,
              "opacity": 1,
              "locked": false,
              "visible": true,
              "groupPath": [],
              "text": "Do not shake the product during use, preventing sewage from entering the motor.\nIt is normal that there is a small amount of water inside the device due to product test.\nBeware of steam/hot water burns during use.\nHigh temperatures may occur when hot water grade and steam grade when in use. Be careful not to spray on persons and animals, as it may cause burns.\nHoses should be regularly inspected, and should not be used if damaged.\nTo reduce the impact of scale on heating efficiency, it is recommended to use purified water in the clean water tank.\nPower off and unplug before winding the power cord.\nAfter each use, remove the clean water tank and turn on the room-temperature water grade in a state of power-on. Press the water outlet button to drain the remaining water in the pipeline, as it may cause odor.",
              "fontFamily": "MiSans",
